Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.34,0:23:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,小鸟 你受伤了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.31,0:23:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 别害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.78,0:23:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.49,0:23:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我是…
